### 健康檢查
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 所有醫師
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Accept: application/json

###

### 依科別篩選
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors?department=內科
Accept: application/json

###

### 單一醫師
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/D001
Accept: application/json

###

### 不存在的醫師 (應回 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/D999
Accept: application/json

###

### 所有科別
GET http://localhost:8080/api/departments
Accept: application/json

### 新增醫師
POST http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "doctorId": "D006",
    "name": "吳大明醫師",
    "department": "家醫科",
    "specialty": "健康檢查、疫苗"
}

###

### 更新醫師
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/D006
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "吳大明醫師",
    "department": "家醫科",
    "specialty": "健康檢查、疫苗、成人預防保健"
}

### 刪除醫師
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/D006

### 測試統計功能網頁端點 
GET http://localhost:8080/stats

### 測試取得總掛號筆數 API 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments/count

### 什麼都沒傳 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments

### 依日期篩選 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?date=2026-05-20

### 依醫師 ID 篩選 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?doctorId=D001

### 同時依日期與醫師 ID 篩選
GET http://localhost:8080/api/appointments?date=2026-05-20&doctorId=D001

### 依病歷號查詢單一病患 
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/TEST00001